  ✅ No CSS pollution - HTMLElement comes with tons of CSS baggage✅ Clean slate - We define exactly what properties exist✅ Type
  safety - TypeScript knows these are TOM elements✅ No conflicts - Can't accidentally use HTML-specific APIs✅ Semantic
  correctness - container and text make sense for terminals

