  ## `estimateShallowMemoryUsageOf` in `bun:jsc`

  The `estimateShallowMemoryUsageOf` function returns a best-effort estimate of the memory usage of an object in bytes, excluding
  the memory usage of properties or other objects it references. For accurate per-object memory usage, use
  `Bun.generateHeapSnapshot`.

  ```js
