  The Terminal Reality:

  // To draw "Hello" at position (10, 5):
  process.stdout.write('\x1b[5;10H');  // Move cursor to row 5, col 10
  process.stdout.write('Hello');       // Write text at cursor position

  // To draw "World" at position (20, 8):
